  "review_notes": [
    "Changed three units. s028 ('alayw) now takes only t036 'with'; s030, which MACULA tags R (the preposition 'et H854 'with', not the object marker H853), takes t039 'with' under rule 11; and t038 'even' becomes its own added unit under rules 16 and 30.",
    "The distribution reading of rule 25 was the verse pass's, and it is named in s028's note. It does not survive rule 52's count: a morpheme stands where the second English word stands, and rule 16's last sentence forbids reading that morpheme as a marker.",
    "Nothing else in the verse changed. The selected variant remains the base reading and 'his companions' is still aligned as ordinary source text."
  ]
